WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two voices, one room. You follow just one.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A third voice appears and calls itself a gorilla.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
For nineteen seconds the sound is there. Some listeners never report it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That is a selective-attention finding, not damaged hearing.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
And no commercial meditation recording was tested.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the experiment, try a free routine, and make your own buying decision.
